<title>HUNGARY: GarAgent CEO buys company shares on bourse.</title>
<headline>GarAgent CEO buys company shares on bourse.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1997-01-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hungarian garage services company GarAgent Rt announced on Thursday that chairman and CEO Kalman Thaisz is buying 182 GarAgent stocks on the Budapest Stock Exchange. The company did not provide further details.</p>
<p>GarAgent stocks belong to the less liquid papers of the market.</p>
<p>On Wednesday GarAgent shares remained untraded but on January 21 they closed at 1,645 forints.</p>
<p>-- Budapest newsroom +36 1 327-4040</p>
</text>
